Jack Olivia \'97 Structural Engineering Consultancy
\f2\b\fs28 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 Jack Olivia is an independent structural engineering consultancy working across London and the South East. We work closely with architects, homeowners, developers and contractors to deliver thoughtful, practical structural design that complements the architecture and works in practice.
\f3\fs24 \

\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667 \ul Our projects \ulnone include house extensions, loft conversions, structural alterations, refurbishments and new-build homes. We provide structural design, calculations and drawings, feasibility advice, structural inspections and support throughout construction.
\f3\fs24 \

\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667 The practice is led by structural engineer Peter Manthorpe BEng (Hons) GIStructE, who brings over a decade of experience to each project. Peter began his career at WSP, progressing from Graduate to Senior Structural Engineer and working on major London developments including London Wall Place and Keybridge House, before moving into residential and development-led structural engineering.
\f3\fs24 \

\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667 This breadth of experience shapes the way we work today \'97 combining rigorous engineering with an understanding of architecture, buildability, cost and the realities of construction.
\f3\fs24 \

\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667 Contact us to discuss your project or arrange an initial consultation.
\f3\fs24 \
