\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667 Peter began his career at WSP, progressing from Graduate to Senior Structural Engineer and working on some of London's significant large-scale developments. This early experience provided a strong grounding in the design of complex steel and reinforced concrete structures, multidisciplinary coordination and the delivery of major construction projects.
